Root cause: the failure is not missing fake state. The degradation test set the client timeout to `1ms`, which can expire even the successful app-monitoring request under the race detector; the route-specific timeout fault only needed to exceed the client timeout. I’m widening the test timeout while keeping the timeout fault deterministic.
